    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "The issue of polymorphism is of immense consideration as not only  electronic, thermal but also physicochemical [1] (solubility, stability  and bioavailability) properties are influenced by this phenomenon.",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "1"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "The identical molecules moiety  can be packed into different periodic crystal structure [2] leading to  distinct packing arrangement.",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "2"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "When appropriate single crystals  cannot be obtained, PXRD becomes the vital tool to tackle the problem  of structure determination [4].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "4"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Hence, opening up many new opportunities in  structural science for microcrystalline powders [4, 5].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "4",
     "5"
    ],
    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "INTRODUCTION The objective of the present manuscript is to use PXRD for studying  the structural aspects of polymorphs of nateglinide, a poorly watersoluble oral hypoglycemic agent [6].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "6"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "The first patent appeared in  1995, explicating the methods for preparing two forms i.e., Form B  and H [8].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "8"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Later, a patent unfolded 26 modifications (polymorphs  and solvates) of nateglinide, using different solvents, anti-solvents  and their mixtures, along with their characterization [9].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "9"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Form S  [10].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "10"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "These researchers  have also proposed the method for evaluating the purity of H  polymorph in the binary mixture of B and H using diffraction  scanning calorimetry (DSC) [11-13].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "11",
     "13"
    ],
    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "Recently, Pasha, et al. have evaluated  few crystal forms by recrystallizing nateglinide from solvents as well  as aqueous solution of surfactants without proper characterization,  interpretation and structure determinat",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "15"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "The major lacuna in the literature is the unavailability of the  structure of either the nateglinide or its reported forms except for  the one crystallographic report of its cocrystal with dilute HCl [8].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "8"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Gang Li, et al. has attempted to solve the structure of two  polymorphs (Form H and S) from PXRD pattern using Jade software  [16].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "16"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "This will aid in spotting polymorphic structure with  minimum energy (the global minimum) [18].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "18"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Int J Pharm Pharm Sci, Vol 9, Issue 10, 119-127",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "9",
     "10",
     "119",
     "127"
    ],
    "n": 4
   },
   {
    "frase": "regions in crystal energy landscape grab attention to locate the  thermodynamically viable polymorph [19].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "19"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "These properties are also influenced by  the crystal morphology, [20] which is the critical parameter for the  quality assessment of the crystalline material [21].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "20",
     "21"
    ],
    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "Thus, screening of  all the plausible crystal structures and their morphology takes us one  step ahead for better understanding and controlling polymorphism  [22].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "22"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "It is an important aspect for quality, safety and efficacy of  a drug product [23].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "23"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "This is based on the  assumption that the crystal face growth rate is proportional to its  attachment energy (AE) [25-27].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "25",
     "27"
    ],
    "n": 2
   },
   {
    "frase": "The procedure  followed was same as in our earlier work [28].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "28"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "120",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "120"
    ],
    "n": 1
   },
   {
    "frase": "Int J Pharm Pharm Sci, Vol 9, Issue 10, 119-127",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "9",
     "10",
     "119",
     "127"
    ],
    "n": 4
   },
   {
    "frase": "However, these authors have used  different solvents to prepare Form B [8, 29].",
    "numeri_non_coperti": [
     "8",
     "29"
    ],
    "n": 2
